# Every text file is LF in the tree and LF on every checkout. A Windows runner
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which turned scripts/install.sh into CRLF on
# checkout and broke every test that searched it for an LF-delimited heredoc.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Terminal captures keep the exact bytes the pty produced, CR included.
docs/evidence/** -text
